From b6847f5ceb27c16fdd11dc5e5c08b513f08ea8bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:27:47 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] drm/panel: Add Ilitek IL97680A panels for Retroid Pocket
 Nova and Duo

Add support for the 1280x960 command-mode panel in the Retroid Pocket
Nova and the bottom panel in the Retroid Pocket Duo. Both use four
DSI lanes with RGB888 pixels and support fixed 60 Hz and 120 Hz modes.
Select the refresh rate through the panel initialization sequence and
control brightness with DCS writes.

Share the panel timings and initialization while selecting five supplies
for the Nova and three for the Duo. Use managed panel registration and
DSI attachment, expose panel orientation and register a DCS backlight.
Complete disable even when a shutdown command fails so the core's
enabled state remains consistent with the subsequent power-down.

Based on Teguh Sobirin's RetroidPocket driver. Jacob Pyke adapted the
variant supply handling and shared description, removed brightness
readback, and updated naming and shutdown error handling for submission.

Link: https://github.com/RetroidPocket/linux/commit/32d07e207d8c09b97b9ad5009999c32c7058d4af
Signed-off-by: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
Signed-off-by: Jacob Pyke <jacob@pyk.ee>
---
 MAINTAINERS                                   |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig                 |  11 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile                |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-ilitek-il97680a.c | 394 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 407 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-ilitek-il97680a.c

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index d1be1cf2b93c..70d04c387002 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -8240,6 +8240,7 @@ M:	Jacob Pyke <jacob@pyk.ee>
 L:	dri-devel@lists.freedesktop.org
 S:	Maintained
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/ilitek,il97680a.yaml
